    "body": "BIP 89, BIP 114 and BIP 441 use `<ref>…</ref>` footnotes but none of them contains a `<references/>` tag. GitHub's mediawiki renderer only emits the footnote bodies where that tag appears, so on the rendered pages the footnote text is missing and the `[n]` superscripts point at `#cite_note-n` anchors that do not exist (e.g. BIP 89's notes on `lift_x`, auxiliary randomness and `blindsecnonce`; BIP 441's five rationale notes).\n\nThis adds a `Footnotes` section with `<references/>` to BIP 89 and BIP 441 (before Acknowledgements/Thanks, matching BIP 340), and puts the tag under BIP 114's existing `References` section.\n\nRendering-only change, no text of the BIPs is modified, so no changelog entries were added; happy to add one for BIP 89 if preferred.\n",
